### ============================================================
### Novel Archive API Test
### 前提：
###   ・既存データ：53件
###   ・NOVEL_ID=31：「诡秘之主」
###   ・次回採番ID：54
### ============================================================


### ============================================================
### 1. 一覧・詳細取得
### ============================================================

### 一覧取得（正常）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/novels


### 詳細取得（正常）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/novels/31


### 詳細取得（異常：存在しないID）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/novels/9999


### ============================================================
### 2. 登録
### ============================================================

### 登録（正常：読了・評価あり）
### → NOVEL_ID=54 を想定
POST http://localhost:8080/api/novels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "APIテスト小説1",
  "author": "テスト作者1",
  "readingStatus": 2,
  "rating": 10,
  "memo": "登録テスト"
}


### 登録（正常：未読・評価なし）
### → NOVEL_ID=55 を想定
POST http://localhost:8080/api/novels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "APIテスト小説2",
  "author": "",
  "readingStatus": 0,
  "rating": null,
  "memo": ""
}


### 登録（正常：作者未入力）
### → NOVEL_ID=56 を想定
POST http://localhost:8080/api/novels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "APIテスト小説3",
  "author": "",
  "readingStatus": 2,
  "rating": 8,
  "memo": "作者なしテスト"
}


### 登録（異常：タイトル未入力）
### → 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/novels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "テスト作者",
  "readingStatus": 2,
  "rating": 8,
  "memo": ""
}


### 登録（異常：読書状態未入力）
### → 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/novels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "API異常テスト1",
  "author": "テスト作者",
  "readingStatus": null,
  "rating": 8,
  "memo": ""
}


### 登録（異常：読書状態範囲外）
### → 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/novels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "API異常テスト2",
  "author": "テスト作者",
  "readingStatus": 4,
  "rating": 8,
  "memo": ""
}


### 登録（異常：評価範囲外）
### → 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/novels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "API異常テスト3",
  "author": "テスト作者",
  "readingStatus": 2,
  "rating": 11,
  "memo": ""
}


### 登録（異常：未読なのに評価あり）
### → 400 Bad Request
### → rating にValidRatingのエラーが設定されること
POST http://localhost:8080/api/novels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "API異常テスト4",
  "author": "テスト作者",
  "readingStatus": 0,
  "rating": 8,
  "memo": ""
}


### 登録（異常：未読以外なのに評価なし）
### → 400 Bad Request
### → rating にValidRatingのエラーが設定されること
POST http://localhost:8080/api/novels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "API異常テスト5",
  "author": "テスト作者",
  "readingStatus": 2,
  "rating": null,
  "memo": ""
}


### 登録（異常：タイトル重複）
### → 409 Conflict
### → NOVEL_ID=31「诡秘之主」が既に存在
POST http://localhost:8080/api/novels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "诡秘之主",
  "author": "爱潜水的乌贼",
  "readingStatus": 2,
  "rating": 10,
  "memo": "タイトル重複テスト"
}


### ============================================================
### 3. 更新
### 登録テストで作成した NOVEL_ID=54 を使用
### ============================================================

### 更新（正常）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/novels/54
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "APIテスト小説1",
  "author": "テスト作者1",
  "readingStatus": 2,
  "rating": 9,
  "memo": "更新テスト"
}


### 更新（正常：自分自身と同じタイトル）
### → タイトル重複エラーにならないこと
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/novels/54
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "APIテスト小説1",
  "author": "テスト作者1",
  "readingStatus": 1,
  "rating": 8,
  "memo": "同一タイトル更新テスト"
}


### 更新（正常：未読へ変更）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/novels/54
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "APIテスト小説1",
  "author": "テスト作者1",
  "readingStatus": 0,
  "rating": null,
  "memo": "未読へ変更"
}


### 更新（異常：タイトル未入力）
### → 400 Bad Request
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/novels/54
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "テスト作者1",
  "readingStatus": 2,
  "rating": 8,
  "memo": ""
}


### 更新（異常：読書状態未入力）
### → 400 Bad Request
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/novels/54
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "APIテスト小説1",
  "author": "テスト作者1",
  "readingStatus": null,
  "rating": 8,
  "memo": ""
}


### 更新（異常：読書状態範囲外）
### → 400 Bad Request
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/novels/54
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "APIテスト小説1",
  "author": "テスト作者1",
  "readingStatus": 4,
  "rating": 8,
  "memo": ""
}


### 更新（異常：評価範囲外）
### → 400 Bad Request
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/novels/54
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "APIテスト小説1",
  "author": "テスト作者1",
  "readingStatus": 2,
  "rating": 11,
  "memo": ""
}


### 更新（異常：未読なのに評価あり）
### → 400 Bad Request
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/novels/54
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "APIテスト小説1",
  "author": "テスト作者1",
  "readingStatus": 0,
  "rating": 8,
  "memo": ""
}


### 更新（異常：未読以外なのに評価なし）
### → 400 Bad Request
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/novels/54
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "APIテスト小説1",
  "author": "テスト作者1",
  "readingStatus": 2,
  "rating": null,
  "memo": ""
}


### 更新（異常：他の小説とタイトル重複）
### → 409 Conflict
### → NOVEL_ID=31「诡秘之主」と重複
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/novels/54
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "诡秘之主",
  "author": "テスト作者1",
  "readingStatus": 2,
  "rating": 8,
  "memo": "タイトル重複テスト"
}


### 更新（異常：存在しないID）
### → 404 Not Found
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/novels/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "存在しない小説",
  "author": "テスト作者",
  "readingStatus": 2,
  "rating": 8,
  "memo": ""
}


### ============================================================
### 4. 更新日時確認
### ============================================================

### 更新後データ取得
### → UPDATED_ATをAPIでは返していないため、
###   DB上でUPDATED_ATが更新されていることを確認
GET http://localhost:8080/api/novels/54


### ============================================================
### 5. 削除
### ※ 最後に実行
### ============================================================

### 削除（正常）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/novels/54


### 削除後取得（異常）
### → 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/novels/54


### 削除（異常：存在しないID）
### → 404 Not Found
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/novels/9999